        "candidate_id": "C_f9ab5490f06e142a_0",
        "edit": "Fix truncated one-hot literals in the case statement: 3'b100 now assigns 8'b0001_0000 and 3'b111 now assigns 8'b1000_0000, correcting the missing zero bits that caused the observed output mismatches.",
